<section class="copy-section" id="your-digital-protection-deserves-the-same-care" aria-labelledby="your-digital-protection-deserves-the-same-care-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="your-digital-protection-deserves-the-same-care-heading">Your digital protection deserves the same care.</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>You choose carefully who advises you, how you invest and what you share. Yet your digital life can still run on vendor defaults and arrangements made years ago.</p>
<p>Default settings were not chosen around your personal risks. Toza gives your protection deliberate attention: what needs to remain private, how it could be exposed and which changes will make a difference in your circumstances.</p>
</div></div></section>
<section class="copy-section" id="personal-shield" aria-labelledby="personal-shield-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="personal-shield-heading">Personal Shield: protection built around your risks.</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p><strong>&#x20AA;14,000 including VAT &#xB7; One person &#xB7; Two devices</strong></p>
<p>Toza will harden one main phone and one PC, iPad or second phone, with their relevant identities, accounts, apps and data access. The work strengthens sign-in and recovery, addresses unwanted access and changes sharing arrangements around the risks identified with you.</p>
<p>Where needed, we establish new core accounts and migrate essential identity, recovery and critical-service access. Two compatible physical security keys are supplied, configured and tested. We test material changes, verify the applicable work and teach you how to use the resulting setup and practical security habits. You receive a private dated record of the work.</p>
<p>One primary working day is included, with a second if needed, followed by 14 days of limited adjustment support for issues directly related to our changes. You remain present, control your credentials and approve material changes.</p>
<p><a href="/en/pricing.html">Personal Shield, group protection and complete inclusions</a></p>
</div></div></section>
<section class="copy-section" id="international-expertise-applied-to-your-private-life" aria-labelledby="international-expertise-applied-to-your-private-life-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="international-expertise-applied-to-your-private-life-heading">International expertise, applied to your private life.</h2></div><div class="section-detail">
<p>Dr. Lior Tabansky&apos;s work has included national cybersecurity strategy and collaborative cyber-resilience projects with the World Bank across 11 countries. Through Toza, he personally understands your circumstances and carries out the technical work with you.</p>
<p>Toza applies relevant practices from public UK NCSC, US NSA and US Department of Defense guidance to your personal risks: protecting accounts and devices, reducing information exposure and changing operational security habits.</p>
